		\item Data Collection and Preparation\\	
		A large-scale Nepali news dataset was collected from specified source. The dataset was organized into predefined categories such as Politics \& Governance, Economy \& Business, Sports,Arts, Culture \& Lifestyle,etc. Duplicate and noisy samples were removed to improve data quality. 
